# Claude Code Mobile — .gitignore
#
# Generated first (highest precedence), then build outputs, then IDE
# / OS noise. Keep this list in priority order: most likely to pollute
# the working tree first, biggest blobs last.

# ─── Node.js ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-store/
package-lock.json.bak

# ─── Vite / build outputs ──────────────────────────────────────────
dist/
build/
*.tsbuildinfo
.vite/

# ─── Capacitor (regenerated by `npx cap sync` and the asset scripts)
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Everything inside ios/ is regenerated on the macOS GitHub Actions
# runner. Keeping it out of the repo keeps the working tree small and
# prevents stale Xcode project files from leaking through. To commit a
# custom Info.plist, AppIcon, or splash screen, delete the matching
# line below.
ios/
# Exceptions — keep these if you hand-edit them and want them tracked:
# !ios/App/App/Info.plist
# !ios/App/App/Assets.xcassets/AppIcon.appiconset/
# !ios/App/App/Assets.xcassets/Splash.imageset/
capacitor-cordova-ios-plugins/

# ─── Xcode / CocoaPods (defense-in-depth even though ios/ is ignored)
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.xcodeproj/xcuserdata/
*.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
*.xcscmblueprint
*.xccheckout
DerivedData/
build/
*.ipa
*.dSYM.zip
*.dSYM
*.swp
*.lock
Pods/
*.hmap
*.ipa
*.xcarchive

# ─── Editor / IDE ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ─── OS noise ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
ehthumbs.db
ehthumbs_vista.db

# ─── Env / secrets ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.pem
*.key
*.p12

# ─── Sharp / image tooling ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Sharp's native binaries are in node_modules — already covered above.
# Generated assets (icons, splash screens) live in ios/ — already
# covered above.

# ─── Logs ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
logs/
*.log

# ─── Coverage / test outputs ───────────────────────────────────────
coverage/
.nyc_output/
*.lcov
